      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The consultant said the team could at least send its proposal to the burial council for its consideration.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:42:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A commissioner noted a known burial on an adjacent lot.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:37:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The consultant proposed no ground disturbance until a new archaeological study and monitoring plan are done.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:32:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "A new consultant said the team will start a new archaeological study in place of the earlier firm's work.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:19:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "About five people came to a small public hearing at the site, with no negative comments.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:16:20",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-03",
      "text": "The commission heard an update on seven new single-family homes planned in a Lahaina historic district.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vhZUiN4y4Zw",
        "ts": "1:14:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:02.794Z"
      },
      "body": "Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "Staff confirmed the owners' representative will get a letter outlining the motion.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "3:17:27",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "The item returns to the commission no later than the September 3rd meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "3:16:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "The commission voted five in favor to defer the item to no later than its September 3rd meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "3:16:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "Their representative asked the commission to remove its earlier requests for a cultural impact study and burial council review.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "2:13:21",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "The owners have not heard back from the state historic preservation division.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "1:44:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-02",
      "text": "The representative could not say the owners reached out to the people who raised concerns in 2022.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "F1fUs_ROA_Q",
        "ts": "1:39:35",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:22.251Z"
      },
      "body": "Maui Cultural Resources Commission"
    },
    {
